#. key: a dry fountain
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a dry fountain"
msgid ""
"A dried-up decorative fountain that has seen better days.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vyschlá fontána, která již zaznamenala lepší časy.\n"

#. key: a gate leading back out of this place
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gate leading back out of this place"
msgid ""
"A gate that will let you return whence you came.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tato brána vede zpět do žaláře.\n"

#. key: a gateway to hell
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a gateway to hell"
msgid ""
"A gateway leading to the Vestibule of Hell. Few would go there voluntarily.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tato brána vede do předsálí pekla. Jen málokdo by tam šel dobrovolně.\n"

#. key: a crawl-hole back to the lair
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a crawl-hole back to the lair"
msgid ""
"A passage leading back to the Lair of Beasts.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento průchod vede zpět k méně stísněným prostorám s menším počtem pavučin.\n"

#. key: a closed door
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a closed door"
msgid ""
"A closed wooden door. All monsters that can wield equipment, and some of them\n"
"that can't, may open it again. If it is opened by a monster while it is aware\n"
"of you, it has a chance of breaking.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dřevěné dveře. Chcete-li je otevřít, zkuste do nich jednoduše vejít, nebo\n"
"stiskněte „O“.\n"

#. key: a large window
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a large window"
msgid ""
"A window embedded in the side of an enormous metal pipe, allowing observation\n"
"of the water flowing inside.\n"
msgstr ""
"Okno vložené do boku obrovského kovového potrubí, což umožňuje pozorování\n"
"tekoucí vody uvnitř.\n"

#. key: a dead tree
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a dead tree"
msgid ""
"The dry remains of a long-dead tree.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento strom je mrtvý jako všechno ostatní tady.\n"

#. key: a golden statue
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a golden statue"
msgid ""
"A solid gold statue of a saint.\n"
msgstr ""
"Socha věštce z ryzího zlata.\n"

#. key: a sarcophagus
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a sarcophagus"
msgid ""
"An ancient sarcophagus. It appears to be empty.\n"
msgstr ""
"Starověký sarkofág. Zdá být prázdný.\n"

#. key: an exit from the tutorial
#: dat/descript/features.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:an exit from the tutorial"
msgid ""
"A way out of the dungeon, letting you finish this lesson.\n"
msgstr ""
"Toto je cesta ven z žaláře, umožní vám dokončit tuto lekci.\n"

#. key: bardiche
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bardiche"
msgid ""
"A long pole with an enormous, cleaving blade on one end.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dlouhá tyč s obrovskou čepelí určenou k sekání na konci.\n"

#. key: book of fixed level
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of fixed level"
msgid ""
"A book of magic spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kniha kouzel.\n"

#. key: book of fixed theme
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of fixed theme"
msgid ""
"A book of magic spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kniha kouzel.\n"

#. key: cloak
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak"
msgid ""
"A cloth cloak.\n"
msgstr ""
"Plátěný plášť.\n"

#. key: corpse
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corpse"
msgid ""
"A corpse. Useless and dead.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mrtvola. Je možno ji nasekat na poživatelné kousky.\n"

#. key: crystal plate armour
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crystal plate armour"
msgid ""
"An incredibly heavy but extremely effective suit of crystalline armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"Neuvěřitelně těžká, ale extrémně efektivní zbroj z křišťálu.\n"

#. key: decaying skeleton
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:decaying skeleton"
msgid ""
"A decaying skeleton.\n"
msgstr ""
"Rozpadající se kostra.\n"

#. key: demon blade
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon blade"
msgid ""
"A terrible weapon, forged in the fires of Hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"Strašná zbraň, kovaná v ohni pekla.\n"

#. key: demon whip
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon whip"
msgid ""
"A terrible weapon, woven in the depths of the inferno.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hrozivá zbraň, spletená v hloubi pekelného ohně.\n"

#. key: giant spiked club
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:giant spiked club"
msgid ""
"A giant lump of wood with sharp spikes at one end.\n"
msgstr ""
"Obrovský kus dřeva s ostrými hroty na jednom konci.\n"

#. key: glaive
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:glaive"
msgid ""
"A pole with a large, heavy blade on one end.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tyč s obrovskou těžkou čepelí na konci.\n"

#. key: gold piece
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gold piece"
msgid ""
"A pile of glittering gold coins.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hromada třpytivých zlatých mincí.\n"

#. key: helmet
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:helmet"
msgid ""
"A piece of metal headgear.\n"
msgstr ""
"Část kovové pokrývky hlavy.\n"

#. key: lajatang
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lajatang"
msgid ""
"A very rare and extremely effective weapon, featuring a pole with half-moon\n"
"blades at both ends.\n"
msgstr ""
"Velmi vzácná a velmi efektivní dovážená zbraň. Představuje jí tyč s\n"
"půlměsícovým ostřím na obou koncích.\n"

#. key: longbow
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:longbow"
msgid ""
"A long, strong bow made of yew.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dlouhý, silný luk z tisu. Způsobuje výborné poškození v boji a zručný\n"
"lukostřelec jej může použít s velkým efektem.\n"

#. key: orb of zot
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb of zot"
msgid ""
"An invaluable artefact. Once you have escaped to the surface with it, your\n"
"quest is complete.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tvá práce je hotova jakmile se ti podaří s tímto cenným artefaktem utéct na\n"
"povrch.\n"

#. key: pair of boots
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pair of boots"
msgid ""
"A pair of boots. They are worn on the feet, and cover all but the largest\n"
"hooves and talons.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pár bot.\n"

#. key: pair of gloves
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pair of gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves. They are worn on the hands, and cover all but the largest\n"
"claws.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pár rukavic.\n"

#. key: potion of berserk rage
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of berserk rage"
msgid ""
"A potion which can send one into an incoherent rage, granting them a great but\n"
"temporary increase to their health, damage, and speed. In exchange, their mind\n"
"is clouded by anger, only allowing them to move and attack in melee. The rage\n"
"will wear off quickly if they do not attack monsters, and upon expiry, the\n"
"imbiber will be fatigued, causing them to slow dramatically and rendering them\n"
"unable to berserk again for a short duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lekvar, který je schopen uvrhnout uživatele do bezmyšlenkovitého hněvu.\n"

#. key: potion of invisibility
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of invisibility"
msgid ""
"A potion which confers invisibility on one who consumes it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lektvar, který vás skrývá před zraky ostatních.\n"

#. key: potion of might
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of might"
msgid ""
"A potion which greatly increases the power of the drinker's melee attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"Magický nápoj, výrazně zvyšující fyzickou sílu člověka, který jej vypije.\n"

#. key: quarterstaff
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quarterstaff"
msgid ""
"A sturdy wooden pole, meant for fighting.\n"
msgstr ""
"Robustni dreveni kul určenej k boji.\n"

#. key: ring of dexterity
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of dexterity"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the dexterity of its wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tenhle prsten zvyšuje nebo snižuje hbitost svého nositele, v závislosti na tom,\n"
"nakolik je prsten okouzlen.\n"

#. key: ring of evasion
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of evasion"
msgid ""
"A ring that makes its wearer more capable of avoiding attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tenhle prsten  svemu nositeli umoznuje více či mene  vyhnout se utokum, v\n"
"zavislosti na stupni okouzleni.\n"

#. key: ring of protection from cold
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of protection from cold"
msgid ""
"A ring that protects its wearer from cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento prsten zajišťuje ochranu před chladem.\n"

#. key: ring of see invisible
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of see invisible"
msgid ""
"A ring that allows its wearer to see invisible things.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento prsten umožňuje svému nositeli vidět věci skryté pohledu kouzlem.\n"

#. key: ring of wizardry
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of wizardry"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the success rate of its wearer's magical spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento prsten zvyšuje schopnost svého nositele k použití magických kouzel.\n"

#. key: scroll of fear
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of fear"
msgid ""
"A scroll that causes great fear in nearby foes, causing them to flee until\n"
"attacked, cornered, or enough time has passed.\n"
"\n"
"Non-living, undead and plant monsters cannot be feared, and berserk or frenzied\n"
"monsters are also immune.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento svitek způsobuje velký strach v těch, které vidí ten, kdo ho čte.\n"

#. key: scroll of fog
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of fog"
msgid ""
"A scroll that surrounds the reader with a dense cloud of fog, which can block\n"
"vision temporarily. The fog takes a short time to fully spill out.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento svitek obklopí čtenáře hustým oblakem mlhy.\n"

#. key: wand of polymorph
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of polymorph"
msgid ""
"A magical device which causes a creature to be transmogrified into another\n"
"form. It is especially effective against shape-changing creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"Magické zařízení, které způsobí, že se bytost promění do jiné formy. To je\n"
"obzvláště účinné proti tvar-měnící bytosti.\n"

#. key: amulet
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet"
msgid ""
"An amulet to be worn as jewellery around the neck, charged with arcane powers\n"
"of unknown provenance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Talisman, který lze nosit coby šperk kolem krku, nabitý magickými silami\n"
"neznámého původu.\n"

#. key: potion
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion"
msgid ""
"An unlabelled flask containing a single dose of unknown liquid.\n"
msgstr ""
"Neoznačená baňka, obsahující jednu dávku neznámé kapaliny.\n"

#. key: ring
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring"
msgid ""
"A ring charged with arcane forces of unknown provenance, to be worn as jewellery\n"
"on a finger.\n"
msgstr ""
"Talisman s nábojem magických sil neznámého původu, který se nosí coby šperk na\n"
"prstu.\n"

#. key: scroll
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll"
msgid ""
"A disposable arcane formula inscribed on parchment by a professional scribe or\n"
"sorcerer. Anyone can evoke the power of the arcane formula by reading it out\n"
"loud, but the nature of that power is not a priori apparent.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jednorázová magická formule, zapsaná na pergamen písařem z povolání nebo\n"
"kouzelníkem. Přečtením nahlas může kdokoliv vyvolat její moc, ale povaha jejího\n"
"účinku není předem známa.\n"

#. key: staff
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff"
msgid ""
"A staff improved with arcane powers of unknown nature.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hůl, zlepšená magickými silami neznámé povahy.\n"

#. key: wand
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand"
msgid ""
"An unusually magical sort of stick.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hůlka. Možná i kouzelná.\n"

#. key: singing sword
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:singing sword"
msgid ""
"An enchanted blade which loves nothing more than to sing to its owner, whether\n"
"they want it to or not.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jedinou zálibou této očarované zbraně je zpívat svému majiteli, ať už je mu to\n"
"po chuť či nikoliv.\n"

#. key: wrath of trog
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wrath of trog"
msgid ""
"A bloodstained axe that was the favourite weapon of the old god Trog, before it\n"
"was lost. It induces a bloodthirsty berserker rage when used in battle, although\n"
"mere mortals who wield it will find themselves temporarily overwhelmed by Trog's\n"
"power.\n"
msgstr ""
"Než se jednoho dne ztratila, byla tato zbraň oblíbeným nástrojem starého\n"
"božstva Troga. Způsobuje bezhlavý, krvežíznivý vztek u každého, kdo s ní uhodí\n"
"jiného.\n"

#. key: mace of variability
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mace of variability"
msgid ""
"A large mace said to have appeared when Xom grew bored with the predictability\n"
"of more ordinary instruments of chaos.\n"
msgstr ""
"Je poněkud nespolehlivý.\n"

#. key: scythe of curses
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scythe of curses"
msgid ""
"A scythe surrounded by an ominous aura of dread. It carries a terrible and\n"
"ancient curse, which it busily inflicts on both the wielder and their enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tato zbraň nese strašlivé a vysoce znepokojivé prokletí.\n"

#. key: sceptre of torment
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sceptre of torment"
msgid ""
"An accursed bone sceptre, created by some unknown hellish power. When used in\n"
"combat, it causes agonising pain in all those unfortunate enough to gaze upon\n"
"it, save for the wielder.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tato skrz naskrz prokletá zbraň je pekelným nástrojem.\n"

#. key: faerie dragon scales
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:faerie dragon scales"
msgid ""
"An enchanted suit of armour created from the scales of a rare breed of dragon,\n"
"now thought to be extinct. This prized relic is now one of the last proofs that\n"
"the vividly coloured faerie dragons ever existed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pohádkoví draci bývali kdysi velmi podobní skvrnitým drakům. Bohužel se jim\n"
"jejich pestré zbarvení stalo zkázou, protože jím odstrašovali potenciální\n"
"kořist. Dnes jsou již vyhynulí, a tento vzácný pozůstatek je jedním z\n"
"posledních důkazů jejich existence.\n"

#. key: scimitar of flaming death
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scimitar of flaming death"
msgid ""
"A scimitar with a mysteriously smoking blade. Occasionally its heat leaks out,\n"
"covering opponents in magical flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kouř!\n"

#. key: dagger of chilly death
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dagger of chilly death"
msgid ""
"A dagger made of one huge shard of sapphire. It covers opponents in ice,\n"
"slowing down their movement somewhat.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dýka z jednoho velkého kusu safíru.\n"

#. key: scythe "finisher"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scythe \"finisher\""
msgid ""
"A long and exceedingly sharp scythe, capable of eviscerating in a single blow.\n"
"Its extraordinary speed is the work of a mad wizard, who spent years refining\n"
"it before discarding it in a fit of rage.\n"
"\n"
"The blade looses a low keen as it cuts through the air.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dlouhá a ostrá kosa, speciálně upravená pro bojové účely.\n"

#. key: giant club "skullcrusher"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:giant club \"skullcrusher\""
msgid ""
"A massive enchanted cudgel that augments the already considerable strength of\n"
"anyone mighty enough to wield it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ať už se jedná o hospodskou rvačku, pořádný masakr nebo něco mezi, tenhle\n"
"roztomilý klacík dovede udělat radost nejednomu obrovi.\n"

#. key: glaive of the guard
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:glaive of the guard"
msgid ""
"A glaive commissioned several years ago by a wealthy queen fearful for the\n"
"safety of her vast treasury. No foe, the smith promised, could defeat a guard\n"
"wielding such a weapon!\n"
"\n"
"It was stolen a few months later, along with the rest of the queen's treasury;\n"
"the guard, it transpired, had been caught napping. Still, it should serve more\n"
"than adequately in the hands of a waking user.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tato zbraň kdysi patřila Garu Doghovi, strážci královské poklady. Podle legendy\n"
"byl ztracen někde v žaláři.\n"

#. key: sword of the dread knight
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sword of the dread knight"
msgid ""
"An adamantine great sword. Its first wielder was a worshipper of Yredelemnul\n"
"who eschewed the use of magic in combat, preferring to destroy her enemies with\n"
"brute force. Unfortunately for her, not all of her opponents shared her\n"
"limitations.\n"
"\n"
"It has felled countless great warriors under her grip, and the souls of those\n"
"who had their lives taken beckon it to take even more under its new owner.\n"
msgstr ""
"Adamantiový velký meč.\n"

#. key: morningstar "eos"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:morningstar \"eos\""
msgid ""
"A jewelled morningstar, glowing brightly with the light of the dawn. It\n"
"illuminates the dungeon's recesses, revealing the machinations of those who\n"
"would prefer to stay invisible.\n"
msgstr ""
"První paprsky úsvitu...\n"

#. key: spear of the botono
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spear of the botono"
msgid ""
"A dark and malign artefact. It increases the potency of hexes cast by anyone\n"
"unwise enough to risk wielding it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Černokněžný, zlovolný artefakt, který zvyšuje účinnost zaklínadel čarovaných\n"
"kýmkoliv, kdo je natolik pošetilý, aby si dovolil jej použít.\n"

#. key: mithril axe "arga"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mithril axe \"arga\""
msgid ""
"A beautiful mithril axe, probably lost by some dwarven hero.\n"
msgstr ""
"Překrásná Mithril sekera, pravděpodobně ji ztratil nějaký trpasličí hrdina.\n"

#. key: longbow "piercer"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:longbow \"piercer\""
msgid ""
"An exceptionally large metal longbow.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mimořádně velký kovový dlouhý luk.\n"

#. key: blowgun of the assassin
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blowgun of the assassin"
msgid ""
"This blowgun seems to guide the needle to seek the most lethal point to hit\n"
"the target, packing a nasty punch.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tato foukačka byla navržena tak, aby se dala snadno skrýt, i přesto však dovede\n"
"uštědřit značnou ránu.\n"

#. key: knife of accuracy
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:knife of accuracy"
msgid ""
"It is almost unerringly accurate.\n"
msgstr ""
"Je téměř neomylně přesná.\n"

#. key: lehudib's crystal spear
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lehudib's crystal spear"
msgid ""
"Presumably this relic led to the invention of the famous spell, or maybe the\n"
"other way around.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tato relikvie pravděpodobně vedle k vynálezu stejnojmenného, slavného kouzla\n"
"Mohlo to ale být i naopak.\n"

#. key: captain's cutlass
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:captain's cutlass"
msgid ""
"An infamous weapon, once used by a vile pirate captain to slaughter countless\n"
"innocents. He finally met his destiny when a kraken swallowed his ship, and the\n"
"cutlass was thought to be lost with him.\n"
msgstr ""
"Touto nechvalně proslulou zbraní zmasakroval zlotřilý kapitán pirátů nespočet\n"
"nevinných. Nakonec se mu stalo osudným, když jeho loď i s celou posádkou\n"
"spolknul kraken. Mělo se za to, že se šavle navždy ztratila, ale právě teď\n"
"držíš ve svých rukou důkaz, že tomu tak není.\n"

#. key: storm bow
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:storm bow"
msgid ""
"A longbow with the colour of dark rain clouds that fires arrows like lightning.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento luk má barvu temných, bouřkových mraků, a line se z něj zápach vlhkého\n"
"ozónu.\n"

#. key: tower shield of ignorance
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tower shield of ignorance"
msgid ""
"A shield unearthed from the remains of a ruined city. It bears an inscription\n"
"written in an ancient language. Scholars and wise men laboured for countless\n"
"hours to decipher it, and in time, a translation was finally settled on:\n"
"\n"
"\"With a shield like this, who needs to think?\"\n"
msgstr ""
"„Otevřená mysl je jako pevnost jejíž brány jsou neblokované a nehlídané.“\n"

#. key: robe of augmentation
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of augmentation"
msgid ""
"A variegated robe, woven with enchantments to enhance the wearer's physical and\n"
"mental abilities. Its creators wove in strands of hair from a hundred different\n"
"animals, each chosen for the unique strengths it could grant the robe's wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Plášť vyrobený z pravého hedvábí.\n"

#. key: cloak of the thief
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak of the thief"
msgid ""
"A pitch-black cloak which allows its wearer to excel in the arts of thievery.\n"
"Even the clumsy will find their footsteps softer and the shouts of their\n"
"adversaries less attention-getting.\n"
msgstr ""
"Umožňuje jeho nositeli, aby vynikl v umění krádeže.\n"

#. key: tower shield "bullseye"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tower shield \"bullseye\""
msgid ""
"Just in case you had trouble getting hit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jen kdybys náhodou měl problém se trefit.\n"

#. key: crown of dyrovepreva
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crown of dyrovepreva"
msgid ""
"A large circlet of dull bronze, set with a dazzling array of gemstones. It was\n"
"first worn by a prince of the Titans, who sought protection from the incessant\n"
"warfare between his fellow princes. In practice, the main effect of the\n"
"artefact was to unite his rivals against him.\n"
msgstr ""
"Velká koruna z temného bronzu, set s oslnivou škálou drahých kamenů.\n"

#. key: hat of the bear spirit
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hat of the bear spirit"
msgid ""
"A fur hat once owned by Ukta, a powerful ogre shaman. It houses the spirit of\n"
"an especially mighty bear, whose rages devastated the ogres until it was slain.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kdysi jej vlastnil Ukta, mocný obří šaman. Tento klobouk z kožešiny v sobě\n"
"skrývá obzvláště silného medvědího ducha.\n"

#. key: robe of misfortune
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of misfortune"
msgid ""
"A splendid flowing robe of fur and silk whose lucky colour has faded.\n"
msgstr ""
"Báječná volná róba vyrobená z kožešin a hedvábí.\n"

#. key: cloak of flash
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak of flash"
msgid ""
"A cloak that twitches and jerks without any intervention.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vibrační plášť.\n"

#. key: lear's hauberk
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lear's hauberk"
msgid ""
"A well-made golden hauberk that covers all of its wearer's body parts. It\n"
"includes a chainmail coif, chausses and maille gauntlets.\n"
msgstr ""
"Řemeslně kvalitní zlaté kroužkové brnění, které pokrývá celé tělo. Součástí je\n"
"kroužková kapuce, nohavice a šupinové pěstnice.\n"

#. key: skin of zhor
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:skin of zhor"
msgid ""
"The {{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"smelly \"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}skin of some strange animal, native to cold and distant lands. It radiates\n"
"the chill of its native habitat.\n"
msgstr ""
"Páchnoucí kůže nějakého podivného zvířete.\n"

#. key: salamander hide armour
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:salamander hide armour"
msgid ""
"Most salamanders' bodies are consigned to the fiery depths from which they\n"
"sprang. Rarely, though, salamanders instead preserve the skins of those that\n"
"passed. The runes and decorations on this hide suggest it once belonged to a\n"
"respected warrior or priest - perhaps even a king. The fiery spirit remains in\n"
"the skin, granting its power to the wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kožená zbroj z mločí kůže.\n"

#. key: gauntlets of war
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gauntlets of war"
msgid ""
"A pair of thick steel gauntlets. They were Okawaru's reward for a mighty\n"
"warlord. The owner is destined to die in battle, but what a death it will be!\n"
msgstr ""
"Tyto hrubé, ocelové rukavice byly darem Okawaru jednomu mocnému válečníkovi.\n"
"Zasloužíš si je i ty?\n"

#. key: shield of resistance
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shield of resistance"
msgid ""
"A bronze shield, looking almost exactly like a tortoise's shell. It was built\n"
"by the adherents of an obscure minor faith, who imbued it with the power of\n"
"their god. As the god is said to, this shield protects against sword and sling,\n"
"frost and flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bronzový štít.\n"

#. key: robe of folly
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of folly"
msgid ""
"A dull grey robe. It is enchanted to provide mages with immeasurable power,\n"
"and more than a little overconfidence...\n"
msgstr ""
"Matný šedý plášť. Je okouzlen, aby opatřil svého nositele nesmírnou mocí a\n"
"moudrostí.\n"

#. key: maxwell's patent armour
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maxwell's patent armour"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour created by the famous inventor Maxwell, providing unparalleled\n"
"protective qualities at a very affordable price. His unorthodox materials left\n"
"it with certain shortcomings, but he's yet to have anyone come back for a\n"
"refund.\n"
msgstr ""
"Podivně vypadající brnění.\n"

#. key: mask of the dragon
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mask of the dragon"
msgid ""
"The mask of the High Priest of ancient Erebora. In ancient times, the gods of\n"
"the Ereborans ceased to answer their prayers, and in desperation, the people\n"
"turned to the forbidden worship of dragons. Now, of their works, only this mask\n"
"remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"Modrá maska.\n"

#. key: scales of the dragon king
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scales of the dragon king"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour created from the enchanted scales of a once-mighty king of\n"
"dragons. In his time, titans and lesser dragons struggled with him in vain —\n"
"but as with all things, even he was eventually cast down and undone. Of his\n"
"life and deeds, this is all that remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kdysi dávno jistý mocný, zlatý drak vzal věci do svých pařátů a vládl všem\n"
"draků ve své části světa. Přesto jeho vláda neměla dlouhého trvání, ukončena\n"
"jedním obyčejným člověkem, který pak z jeho kůže vyhotovil toho brnění.\n"

#. key: hat of the alchemist
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hat of the alchemist"
msgid ""
"A dirty hat. It bears signs of surviving many weird explosions, which suggests\n"
"it may have means of protecting the head inside from the risks involved with\n"
"alchemy experiments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Umolousaný klobouk. Vypadá to, že přežil mnoho podivných výbuchů, což\n"
"naznačuje, že dokáže ochránit hlavu před riziky souvisejícími s alchymistickými\n"
"experimenty. Úroveň této ochrany také s jistotou říká, že dotyčný musel nějaké\n"
"to zranění hlavy již dříve utrpět, když na takovéto experimenty měl byť jen\n"
"pomyšlení.\n"

#. key: fencer's gloves
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fencer's gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves made of white silk.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pár rukavic z bílého hedvábí.\n"

#. key: cloak of starlight
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak of starlight"
msgid ""
"A phosphorescent cloak, woven of pure light beams. The ripples of its folds\n"
"as the wearer leaps and swerves in combat may dazzle those who gaze on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fosforeskující plášť, tkaný z čistých světelných paprsků.\n"

#. key: ratskin cloak
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ratskin cloak"
msgid ""
"A cloak stitched from the hides of hundreds of hell rats by an enchantress with\n"
"far too much time on her hands. Many more rats remain somehow concealed within\n"
"it, and may scurry out to assist the wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jistý kouzelnice s magickým kolovrátkem a spostou času tento plášť vyrobila z\n"
"kůží stovek krys, povětšinou oranžových. Nosí se trochu divně a vypadá docela\n"
"hloupě, ale poskytuje výtečnou ochranu před krysami všeho druhu.\n"

#. key: amulet of the air
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of the air"
msgid ""
"A sky-blue amulet, suffused with enchantments that protect the wearer and make\n"
"their Air spells more powerful. Its creator lacked just one thing: a steady\n"
"hand.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mnoho ze svých ochranných vlastností tento nebesky modrý amulet pravděpodobně\n"
"dostal od nějaké mocného vzdušného mága. Zdá se, že jediné, co mu chybělo,\n"
"byla pevná ruka.\n"

#. key: amulet of cekugob
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of cekugob"
msgid ""
"A strange-looking piece of crystal on an ordinary-looking string, with an odd\n"
"selection of powers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Podivně vyhlížející kus krystalu na obyčejně vypadajícím řetězu s podivným\n"
"výběrem moci.\n"

#. key: amulet of tranquility
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of tranquility"
msgid ""
"A pendant made of purest jade. It grants its wearer immense willpower and\n"
"mental fortitude.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento přívěšek, vyrobený z nejryzejšího nefritu, dává svému nositeli nesmírnou,\n"
"mytickou sílu odolat nepřátelské magii.\n"

#. key: necklace of bloodlust
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:necklace of bloodlust"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of bloodstained human and animal teeth, and something that\n"
"appears to be a piece of spine.\n"
msgstr ""
"Říkáš si, že jen nevkusný hrubián by nosil tento krví zbrocený náhrdelník,\n"
"vyrobený z lidských a zvířecích zubů, a něčeho, co vypadá jako vytržený kus\n"
"páteře.\n"

#. key: ring of the mage
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of the mage"
msgid ""
"An enchanted sapphire, inset into a ring. It aids the spellcasting of its\n"
"wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Očarovaný safír vsazený do prstenu. Svému nositeli umožňuje lépe používat\n"
"magii.\n"

#. key: brooch of shielding
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brooch of shielding"
msgid ""
"A brooch with an intricate inlaid design, providing a range of magical\n"
"protections. Back in the good old days, every adventurer had one of these handy\n"
"devices. That, and a pony.\n"
msgstr ""
"Za starých dobrých časů měl tuto užitečnou věcičku k dispozici každý dobrodruh.\n"
"Tu a ještě poníka.\n"

#. key: robe of clouds
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of clouds"
msgid ""
"A robe of a material as nebulous and insubstantial as the clouds. It whips the\n"
"air around it up into a furious storm as it ripples and swirls.\n"
msgstr ""
"Róba z tak jemného materiálu, že by jeden až řekl, že je z obláčků.\n"

#. key: obsidian axe
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:obsidian axe"
msgid ""
"An axe with a powerful curse placed on it by one of the lords of Pandemonium,\n"
"so that unsuspecting adventurers would unleash demons into this world. Beware,\n"
"for it has ways of taking its wielder under its command...\n"
msgstr ""
"Tato sekera nese s sebou kletbu, uvalenou jedním z pánů Pandemonia, aby nic\n"
"netušící dobrodruzi jako jsi ty do světa přilákali démony. Měj se na pozoru,\n"
"neb tato sekera moc dobře ví, jak svého nositele přinutit poslouchat...\n"

#. key: lightning scales
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lightning scales"
msgid ""
"A set of armoured plates assembled to protect a creature with a long, scaly\n"
"lower body. Faintly crackling with electricity, they supercharge their wearer's\n"
"ability to cover distance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tyto šupiny byly do podoby brnění vyrobeny ze spodní části těla nagy. Tiše\n"
"jiskří a díky svému očarování umožňují nositeli plazit se téměř lidským tempem.\n"

#. key: autumn katana
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:autumn katana"
msgid ""
"An exquisitely crafted sword. Its blade is so sharp that it can cut through\n"
"space itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento exotický meč je zbraň pro skutečně osvícené uživatele.\n"

#. key: shillelagh "devastator"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shillelagh \"devastator\""
msgid ""
"A wooden cudgel, loaded with more than just lead.\n"
msgstr ""
"Odhaduješ, že tahle tyč je nabitá něčím lepším, než jen olovem.\n"

#. key: dragonskin cloak
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dragonskin cloak"
msgid ""
"An opalescent cloak gleaming with the colours of all kinds of dragons. It\n"
"imbues the wearer with draconic resistances, although somewhat unreliably.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento dračí plášť hraje všemi barvami duhy. Svého nositele chrání před\n"
"elementálními útoky všeho druhu, ačkoliv ne zcela spolehlivě.\n"

#. key: ring of the octopus king
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of the octopus king"
msgid ""
"One of the eight rings once worn by the Octopus King and now scattered across\n"
"the land. Each has its own unique enchantment.\n"
msgstr ""
"„Panna mořská, jenž zpívala ráda,\n"
" v králi chobotnic touhu vyvolala.\n"
" Nápadník její mnoho chapadel měl,\n"
" tuze se snažil a pannu chtěl,\n"
" prsteny jeho všechny však navléct nedokázala.“\n"

#. key: axe of woe
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:axe of woe"
msgid ""
"As you hold this axe your mind does not feel fully your own. Your body begins\n"
"to exhibit strength far beyond its capabilities, and your movements become\n"
"guided by Makhleb.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pokud budete držet tuto sekeru, ve své mysli se nebudete cítit úplně sami. Vaše\n"
"tělo začne vykazovat sílu, daleko za svými možnostmi, a vaše pohyby budou\n"
"vedeny Makhleb.\n"

#. key: dispater
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dispater"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most ruthless of the Lords of Hell, Dispater was born when first an\n"
"iron sword drank mortal blood. They despise mortal vanities, the pursuit of\n"
"‘reason’ and ‘beauty’ - the only art they enjoy is the art of war.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vládce železného mesta Dis.\n"

#. key: erolcha
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:erolcha"
msgid ""
"An especially cunning ogre-mage.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zvláště prohnaný zlobr-čaroděj.\n"

#. key: joseph
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:joseph"
msgid ""
"Looks like a mercenary in a stupid-looking hat.\n"
msgstr ""
"Podobá se na žoldnére.\n"

#. key: agony spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:agony spell"
msgid ""
"Cuts the health of a target creature in half. This damage is never directly\n"
"lethal.\n"
msgstr ""
"Toto kouzlo snižuje odolnost cílové bytosti na polovinu,  nikdy nezpůsobuje\n"
"přímo smrt.\n"

#. key: airstrike spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:airstrike spell"
msgid ""
"Causes the air around a creature to twist itself into a whirling vortex of\n"
"meteorological fury. It does more damage to targets surrounded by empty space.\n"
msgstr ""
"Toto kouzlo způsobuje, že se vzduch kolem tvora točí v zuřivém víru. Toto\n"
"kouzlo je zvláště účinné proti létajícím nepřátelům.\n"

#. key: blink spell
#: dat/descript/spells.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blink spell"
msgid ""
"Randomly translocates the caster a short distance. After translocating in this\n"
"way, the spell cannot be cast again for a short period of time depending on\n"
"spell power.\n"
msgstr ""
"Toto kouzlo přenese kouzelníka na krátkou náhodnou vzdálenost .\n"

#. key: elven halls
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elven halls"
msgid ""
"The Elven Halls are home to the deep elves, a race that turned their backs on\n"
"the sun long ago. Their halls are filled with riches, but a deadly welcome\n"
"awaits any would-be robbers. In their long seclusion, the deep elves have\n"
"perfected dark sorceries of a power the orcs can only dream of!\n"
msgstr ""
"Zatímco většina elfích lidí  se nikdy nepřesunula do temného podzemního\n"
"komplexu, jako je tento, hlubinní elfové to udělali. Jejich sály jsou plné\n"
"bohatství, ale všechny kolemjdoucí si musí být vědomi legendární magické\n"
"zdatnosti tohoto druhu.\n"
"\n"
"Elfí sály jsou tří úrovňové.\n"

#. key: lair
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lair"
msgid ""
"Most adventurers find the Lair of Beasts to be an exciting change of climate.\n"
"And indeed, there is something to be said about getting gored, mauled and eaten\n"
"rather than sliced, burnt or stabbed.\n"
"\n"
"The Lair contains the entrances to one of the Swamp or the Shoals, one of the\n"
"Snake Pit or the Spider Nest, and to the Pits of Slime.\n"
msgstr ""
"Většina dobrodruhů shledává Doupě šelem vzrušující změnou prostředí. Na tom, že\n"
"je lepší nechat se nabrat na rohy, podrápat a rozdupat kopyty nežli se nechat\n"
"rozsekat, zapálit nebo probodat opravdu něco bude.\n"
"\n"
"Doupě má osm podlaží a lze v něm nalézt vstup do dalších tří částí žaláře.\n"

#. key: sewer
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sewer"
msgid ""
"Every inhabited place needs to dispose of its waste products. The Dungeon too\n"
"has its stinking sewers and drains, full of filthy water and ignored by most\n"
"but used as hideaways by the disgusting and the desperate. Old tales speak of\n"
"dangerous creatures stalking through the foul-smelling green water, preying on\n"
"each other without mercy. The tales also allude to valuable items accidentally\n"
"washed into the drainage tunnels, forgotten and left to grow mouldy in the damp\n"
"caverns.\n"
msgstr ""
"Každé obydlené místo, se musí zbavit svých odpadních produktů. Žalář má také\n"
"své smradlavé stoky a kanalizace, plné špinavé vody. Jsou to nechutné a\n"
"beznadějné zákoutí. Staré příběhy mluví o nebezpečných tvorech pronásledujících\n"
"oběť přes páchnoucí zelenou vodou, lovících bez slitování. Příběhy se také\n"
"zmiňují o cenných předmětech omylem spláchnutých do odvodňovacích tunelů,\n"
"zapomenutých a časem zplesnivělých ve vlhkých jeskyních.\n"

#. key: volcano
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:volcano"
msgid ""
"Built from enormous blocks of obsidian, the volcano's sweltering chambers may\n"
"once have served as a temple to some strange deity, or perhaps the dwelling of\n"
"a mighty fire giant. The air shimmers with oppressive heat, and the dull roar\n"
"of the volcano's heart never ceases.\n"
msgstr ""
"Postaveno z obrovských bloků obsidiánu, může to být horká komora, která kdysi\n"
"sloužila jako chrám pro nějaké podivné božstvo, nebo možná obydlí mohutného\n"
"ohnivého obra. Vzduch se třpytí tíhou tepla a nudný řev srdce sopky nikdy\n"
"nepřestane.\n"

#. key: banish ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:banish ability"
msgid ""
"Attempts to banish a creature into the Abyss. If the attempt succeeds, you gain\n"
"some piety and the creature's full experience value. Even creatures that resist\n"
"are left malmutated and weakened by the brush with the Abyss. Invocations skill\n"
"makes Banishment harder to resist.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pokoušet vyhnat monstrum do propasti.\n"

#. key: cmd_rest
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_rest"
msgid ""
"Rest and heal\n"
msgstr ""
"Odpočinek a léčení\n"

#. key: cmd_rest verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_rest verbose"
msgid ""
"Rests while your health and magic regenerate. Resting is interrupted as soon\n"
"as a hostile monster comes into view. If health and magic are both already\n"
"full, resting will wait for 100 turns.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hráč stráví až 100 tahů regenerací zdraví a/nebo dobíjením magie, nebo\n"
"prohledáváním okolí. Jakmile se objeví nepřítel, odpočinek je přerušen.\n"

#. key: cmd_explore
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_explore"
msgid ""
"Autoexplore the current level\n"
msgstr ""
"Automaticky prozkoumat současnou úroveň\n"

#. key: cmd_explore verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_explore verbose"
msgid ""
"Automatically explores the current level, collecting items on the way.\n"
"Exploration stops as soon as a hostile monster comes into view, or when you\n"
"encounter new items or features.\n"
msgstr ""
"Umožňuje, aby postava automaticky procestovala neprozkoumané částí současného\n"
"patra a posbírala předměty, které jsou nastaveny pro automatický sběr. Kdykoliv\n"
"je objeven nepřítel, nebo je nalezen předmět či zajímavé místo, cestování je\n"
"zastaveno.\n"

#. key: cmd_interlevel_travel
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_interlevel_travel"
msgid ""
"Travel to distant levels\n"
msgstr ""
"Cestovat do jiných úrovní\n"

#. key: cmd_interlevel_travel verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_interlevel_travel verbose"
msgid ""
"Automatically travels to a chosen level or branch. Travel is interrupted by\n"
"monsters coming into view.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hráč bude automaticky dopraven do zvolené úrovně. Pokud je objeven nepřítel,\n"
"cestování je zastaveno.\n"

#. key: cmd_use_ability
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_use_ability"
msgid ""
"Use divine, innate or evokable abilities\n"
msgstr ""
"Použít božské nebo vrozené schopnosti\n"

#. key: cmd_search_stashes
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_search_stashes"
msgid ""
"Search for items/features\n"
msgstr ""
"Vyhledat předmět/místo\n"

#. key: cmd_search_stashes verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_search_stashes verbose"
msgid ""
"Searches for items or features seen elsewhere, and allows you to travel to\n"
"their location.\n"
msgstr ""
"Umožňuje vyhledat předmět či místo, na které již hráč narazil, a pak tam\n"
"cestovat.\n"

#. key: cmd_replay_messages
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_replay_messages"
msgid ""
"Reread recent messages\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit nedávnou historii zpráv\n"

#. key: cmd_resists_screen
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_resists_screen"
msgid ""
"Display character overview\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit přehled postavy\n"

#. key: cmd_resists_screen verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_resists_screen verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays an overview of your current resistances, abilities, equipment and\n"
"attributes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazí informace o známých odolnostech, schopnostech, vlastnotech předmětů\n"
"atp.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_overmap
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_overmap"
msgid ""
"Display dungeon overview\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit přehled žáláře\n"

#. key: cmd_display_overmap verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_overmap verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays an overview of dungeon branch locations, discovered altars, shops and\n"
"level annotations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazí umístění vstupů do vedlejších částí žaláře, obchodů a dalších\n"
"zajímavých míst, na které jsi zatím narazil.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_religion
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_religion"
msgid ""
"Display religious status\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit informace o náboženství\n"

#. key: cmd_display_religion verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_religion verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays your god's likes and dislikes, conduct, and your current religious\n"
"standing and divine abilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazí, co tebou uctívaný bůh má rád a co nemá, jak se chovat, tvé aktuální\n"
"postavení a udělené privilegia.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_mutations
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_mutations"
msgid ""
"Display mutations\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit mutace\n"

#. key: cmd_display_skills
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_skills"
msgid ""
"Manage skills\n"
msgstr ""
"Spravovat dovednosti\n"

#. key: cmd_display_character_status
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_character_status"
msgid ""
"Display character status\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit stav postavy\n"

#. key: cmd_display_character_status verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_character_status verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays details on your current movement speed, attack speed, stealth, magic\n"
"resistance, and any currently active enchantments or status effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazí aktivní očarování a pár dalších věcí.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_known_objects
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_known_objects"
msgid ""
"List discovered item types\n"
msgstr ""
"Seznam objevených předmětů\n"

#. key: cmd_save_game_now
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_save_game_now"
msgid ""
"Save and exit\n"
msgstr ""
"Uložit a ukončit\n"

#. key: cmd_save_game_now verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_save_game_now verbose"
msgid ""
"Saves the game for later and exits. Once you resume the game, the save file is\n"
"deleted again.\n"
msgstr ""
"Uloží a ukončí hru. Při opětovném vstupu do hry je soubor s uloženou hrou\n"
"smazán.\n"

#. key: cmd_edit_player_tile
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_edit_player_tile"
msgid ""
"Modify the player tile\n"
msgstr ""
"Změnit vzhled postavy\n"

#. key: cmd_edit_player_tile verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_edit_player_tile verbose"
msgid ""
"Allows you to modify the equipment and species tile displayed in the player\n"
"doll.\n"
msgstr ""
"Umožňuje změnit, jak bude tvá postava vypadat co do vybavení a rasy.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_commands
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_commands"
msgid ""
"Game help\n"
msgstr ""
"Nápověda ke hře\n"

#. key: cmd_display_commands verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_commands verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays a list of commands.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seznam příkazů, předvoleb atd.\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight"
msgid ""
"Hit the closest monster\n"
msgstr ""
"Zasáhnout nejbližší monstrum\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight verbose"
msgid ""
"Moves towards the closest hostile monster, or attacks an adjacent monster with\n"
"your current weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pohnout se směrem k nejbližšímu nepříteli a zaútočit pomocí držené zbraně.\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight_nomove
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight_nomove"
msgid ""
"Hit an adjacent monster\n"
msgstr ""
"Zasáhnout nejbližší monstrum\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight_nomove verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight_nomove verbose"
msgid ""
"Attacks an adjacent monster with your current weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zaútočit na nejbližší monstrum pomocí držené zbraně.\n"

#. key: cmd_wait
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_wait"
msgid ""
"Wait a single turn\n"
msgstr ""
"Čekat jeden tah\n"

#. key: cmd_wait verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_wait verbose"
msgid ""
"Spends a single turn waiting and resting.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hráč stráví jeden tah čekáním a odpočinkem.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_inventory
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_inventory"
msgid ""
"Display the contents of your inventory\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit seznam věcí v inventáři\n"

#. key: cmd_display_inventory verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_inventory verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays the contents of your inventory.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazí seznam předmětů, které momentálně máte u sebe.\n"

#. key: cmd_cast_spell
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_cast_spell"
msgid ""
"Cast a spell\n"
msgstr ""
"Seslat kouzlo\n"

#. key: cmd_cast_spell verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_cast_spell verbose"
msgid ""
"Casts a spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sešle zvolené kouzlo.\n"

#. key: cmd_memorise_spell
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_memorise_spell"
msgid ""
"Memorise spell\n"
msgstr ""
"Zapamatovat si kouzlo\n"

#. key: cmd_memorise_spell verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_memorise_spell verbose"
msgid ""
"Memorises a chosen spell from your spell library.\n"
msgstr ""
"Uloží do paměti kouzlo z knihy, kterou má hráč u sebe nebo na které stojí.\n"

#. key: cmd_drop
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_drop"
msgid ""
"Drop items\n"
msgstr ""
"Zahodit předměty\n"

#. key: cmd_drop verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_drop verbose"
msgid ""
"Drops one or more items that you are currently holding.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zahodí jeden či více předmětů, které máš zrovna sebe.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_map
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_map"
msgid ""
"Enter map mode\n"
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit mapu\n"

#. key: cmd_display_map verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_map verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays a map of the current level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Umožňuje zobrazit a pohybovat se po již dříve prozkoumané mapě.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_goto_target
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_goto_target"
msgid ""
"Travel to cursor\n"
msgstr ""
"Cestovat na místo\n"

#. key: cmd_map_goto_target verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_goto_target verbose"
msgid ""
"Starts travelling to the cursor's current location.\n"
msgstr ""
"Započne cestu na místo určené kurzorem.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_add_waypoint
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_add_waypoint"
msgid ""
"Add waypoint\n"
msgstr ""
"Přidat cestovní bod\n"

#. key: cmd_map_add_waypoint verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_add_waypoint verbose"
msgid ""
"Sets a waypoint at your current position.\n"
msgstr ""
"Umožňuje uložit aktuální místo pro pozdější snadné cestování.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_exclude_area
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_exclude_area"
msgid ""
"Create exclusion\n"
msgstr ""
"Zákaz cestování\n"

#. key: cmd_map_exclude_area verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_exclude_area verbose"
msgid ""
"Creates a travel exclusion, changes its radius, or removes it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Umožňuje označit místo, kam automaticky necestovat, případně změnit velikost či\n"
"tuto vyjímku odstranit.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_clear_excludes
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_clear_excludes"
msgid ""
"Clear travel exclusions\n"
msgstr ""
"Odstranit zákazy cestování\n"

#. key: cmd_map_clear_excludes verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_clear_excludes verbose"
msgid ""
"Erases all travel exclusions on the level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Smaže všechny zákazy cestovaní na daném patře.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_next_level
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_next_level"
msgid ""
"Down one level\n"
msgstr ""
"O patro níže\n"

#. key: cmd_map_next_level verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_next_level verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays the next deeper level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přepne zobrazení na nižší patro.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_prev_level
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_prev_level"
msgid ""
"Up one level\n"
msgstr ""
"O patro výše\n"

#. key: cmd_map_prev_level verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_prev_level verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays the next higher level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přepne zobrazení na vyšší patro.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_goto_level
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_goto_level"
msgid ""
"Go to level\n"
msgstr ""
"Cestovat do jiného patra\n"

#. key: cmd_map_goto_level verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_goto_level verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays another chosen level by branch and depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"Automatická cesta do jiného patra žaláře či vedlejší části.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_upstair
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_upstair"
msgid ""
"Find stairs up\n"
msgstr ""
"Najít schody nahoru\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_upstair verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_upstair verbose"
msgid ""
"Cycles through stairs up.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přepíná mezi nalezenými schodišti o patro výše.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_downstair
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_downstair"
msgid ""
"Find stairs down\n"
msgstr ""
"Najít schody dolů\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_downstair verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_downstair verbose"
msgid ""
"Cycles through stairs down.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přepíná mezi nalezenými schodišti o patro níže.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_you
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_you"
msgid ""
"Find me\n"
msgstr ""
"Najít hráče\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_you verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_you verbose"
msgid ""
"Moves the map cursor back to your current position.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přesune kurzor zpět na hráčovu pozici.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_portal
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_portal"
msgid ""
"Find shops and portals\n"
msgstr ""
"Najít obchody a portály\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_portal verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_portal verbose"
msgid ""
"Cycles through shops and portals on the current level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přepíná mezi nalezenými obchody a portály na současném patře.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_trap
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_trap"
msgid ""
"Find traps\n"
msgstr ""
"Najít pasti\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_trap verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_trap verbose"
msgid ""
"Cycles through traps on the current level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přepíná mezi pastmi na současném patře.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_altar
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_altar"
msgid ""
"Find altars\n"
msgstr ""
"Najít oltáře\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_altar verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_altar verbose"
msgid ""
"Cycles through altars on the current level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přepínat mezi oltáři na současném patře.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_excluded
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_excluded"
msgid ""
"Find travel exclusion\n"
msgstr ""
"Najít zákaz cestování\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_excluded verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_excluded verbose"
msgid ""
"Cycles through travel exclusions on the current level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přepíná mezi zákazy cestování na současném patře.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_waypoint
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_waypoint"
msgid ""
"Find waypoint\n"
msgstr ""
"Najít cestovní bod\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_waypoint verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_waypoint verbose"
msgid ""
"Cycles through all waypoints on the current level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přepíná mezi všemi cestovními body na současném patře.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_stash
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_stash"
msgid ""
"Find stash\n"
msgstr ""
"Najít skrýš\n"

#. key: cmd_map_find_stash verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_find_stash verbose"
msgid ""
"Cycles through all stashes on the current level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přepíná mezi všemi uloženými skrýšemi na současném patře.\n"

#. key: cmd_zoom_in
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_zoom_in"
msgid ""
"Zoom in\n"
msgstr ""
"Přiblížit\n"

#. key: cmd_zoom_in verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_zoom_in verbose"
msgid ""
"Zooms in on dungeon area.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přiblíží část žaláře\n"

#. key: cmd_zoom_out
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_zoom_out"
msgid ""
"Zoom out\n"
msgstr ""
"Oddálit\n"

#. key: cmd_zoom_out verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_zoom_out verbose"
msgid ""
"Zooms out on dungeon area.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oddálí část žaláře\n"

#. key: deep elf
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:deep elf"
msgid ""
"Deep Elves have a strong affinity for all kinds of magic, but are very fragile.\n"
"They regenerate magical power rapidly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Magicky nejnadanější z elfů, ale také nejslabší tělem.\n"

#. key: demigod
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:demigod"
msgid ""
"Demigods refuse to worship any god, but make up for this with divine attributes\n"
"and high reserves of health and magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Za žádných okolností nebudou uctívat božstvo, za to však je jim do vínku dáno\n"
"božské zdraví a vlastnosti.\n"

#. key: demonspawn
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:demonspawn"
msgid ""
"Demonspawn are half human, half demon. They acquire strong demonic mutations as\n"
"they grow.\n"
msgstr ""
"Démonik je napůl člověk, napůl démon, který postupně získáva silné démonické\n"
"mutace.\n"

#. key: draconian
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:draconian"
msgid ""
"Draconians are versatile hybrids. They mature when reaching level 7 and develop\n"
"a colour.\n"
msgstr ""
"Drakoni jsou všeumělové, kteří dospívají na sedmé úrovni, kdy získavají\n"
"charakteristický odstín.\n"

#. key: felid
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:felid"
msgid ""
"Felids are many-lived sentient cats. They cannot use armour or weapons.\n"
msgstr ""
"Myslící plemeno koček s mnoha života, které zato nejsou schopny jemné\n"
"manipulace s předměty či používaní zbroje a zbraní.\n"

#. key: gargoyle
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:gargoyle"
msgid ""
"Made of living stone, Gargoyles have a preternatural affinity for earth magic.\n"
"They have low health, but their stone bodies are incredibly tough.\n"
msgstr ""
"Díky tomu, že jsou vytesáni ze žijícího kamene, mají nadpřirozeně pozitivní\n"
"vztah k zemské magii.\n"

#. key: human
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:human"
msgid ""
"Humans are natural explorers. Discovering new places refreshes and invigorates them.\n"
"They are otherwise completely average.\n"
msgstr ""
"Všední a průměrní.\n"

#. key: tengu
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:tengu"
msgid ""
"Tengu are bird-people who love to fight, both with weapons and spells. They are\n"
"fragile but agile, and eventually learn to fly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ptačí lidé, milující jak boj se zbraní, tak s kouzly. Jsou velmi křehcí, ale\n"
"později se naučí svižnému letu.\n"

#. key: merfolk
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:merfolk"
msgid ""
"Half fish, half human, Merfolk are citizens of both water and land. They are\n"
"strong combatants, and adept at using magic to assist in battle.\n"
msgstr ""
"Napůl ryby, napůl lidé, vodnáři jsou doma jak ve vodě, tak na souši. Jsou to\n"
"silní bojovníci, kteří si dovedou v boji na pomoc přivolat magii.\n"

#. key: minotaur
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:minotaur"
msgid ""
"Minotaurs are large muscular humans with bovine heads. They excel at all forms\n"
"of close and ranged combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"Velký, svalnatý člověk s býčí hlavou. Vynikají ve všech formách boje na blízko\n"
"i na dálku.\n"

#. key: mummy
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:mummy"
msgid ""
"Compelled to walk by an ancient curse, Mummies have innate faith and are adept\n"
"at Necromancy, but learn other skills very slowly. They cannot drink potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nemrtvá postava, od hlavy k patě pokrytá obvazy nasáklými v balzamovacím\n"
"roztoku, která je nucena kráčet kvůli starobylé kletbě.\n"

#. key: naga
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:naga"
msgid ""
"Nagas are hybrids: human from the waist up, with a snake-like tail instead of\n"
"legs. They move very slowly but are naturally resilient.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kříženci s lidským trupem a šupinatou, svalnatou spodní částí těla, kterou jako\n"
"hadi tahají za sebou. Pohybují se pomalu, ale jsou od přírody odolní.\n"

#. key: octopode
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:octopode"
msgid ""
"Octopodes are a species of amphibious cephalopods. They can wear eight rings,\n"
"but almost no armour fits them.\n"
msgstr ""
"Druh obojživelných hlavonožců schopných nosit osm prstenů, kterým však nepadne\n"
"téměř žádná zbroj.\n"

#. key: spriggan
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:spriggan"
msgid ""
"Very small, very frail and very fast, Spriggans are highly competent stabbers\n"
"and spellcasters.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hodně malí, hodně slabí a hodně rychlí. Sprigané jsou vysoce schopní co se týče\n"
"bodání dýky do zad a kouzlení.\n"

#. key: troll
#: dat/descript/species.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:gamestart:troll"
msgid ""
"Trolls are monstrous creatures with powerful claws. They regenerate health\n"
"rapidly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Velcí surovci, kteří neváhají svými drápy rozsápat, co jim pod ruku přijde.\n"
"Neustále mají hlad.\n"

#. key: death
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:death"
msgid ""
"Condolences! Your character's premature death is a sad, but common occurrence\n"
"in Crawl. Rest assured that with diligence and playing experience your\n"
"characters will last longer.\n"
"\n"
"Perhaps the following advice can improve your playing style:\n"
msgstr ""
"Upřímnou soustrast! Předčasná smrt vaší postavy je smutná, ale běžný jev při\n"
"procházení bludištěm. Ujišťujeme vás, že pílí a herními zkušenostmi budou vaše\n"
"postavy přetrvávat déle.\n"
"\n"
"Snad následující doporučení pomůže zlepšit váš styl hraní:\n"

#. key: death conjurer melee
#: dat/descript/hints.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:death conjurer melee"
msgid ""
"As a Conjurer your main weapon should be offensive magic. Cast spells more\n"
"often! Remember to rest when your Magic is low.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jako mág by jste měl mít hlavní zbraní ofenzivní magii. Sesílat kouzla častěji!\n"
"Nezapomeňte si odpočinout, když je váše magie nízká.\n"

#. key: tutorial1 close_door
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial1 close_door"
msgid ""
"To close an open door, press <input>$cmd[CMD_CLOSE_DOOR]</input>.\n"
msgstr ""
"Chcete-li zavřít otevřené dveře, stiskněte tlačítko\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_CLOSE_DOOR]</input>.\n"

#. key: tutorial5 tutorial_end
#: dat/descript/tutorial.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:hints:tutorial5 tutorial_end"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've finished the last tutorial lesson and are now ready for\n"
"the real game. Good luck!\n"
"\n"
"To exit the tutorial, just go down these stairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gratulujeme! Skončili jste poslední výukovou lekci a nyní jste připraveni pro\n"
"skutečnou hru. Hodně štěstí!\n"
"\n"
"Chcete-li ukončit výuku, stačí jít dolů na schody.\n"

